BC-250 Mesa patch series and helpers
====================================

This directory carries two separately licensed sets of files.

Mesa patch series (patches/0001-0007)
--------------------------------------
Source:  https://github.com/MastaG/linux-cachyos-bc250
Commit:  f05991ace64a42eda3d2dc583e96b8d35ce393e3
License: GPL-2.0-only (LICENSE-GPL-2.0)

  0001  expose the ACE compute queue and apply the GFX1013 async-compute
        dispatch workaround
  0002  DirectMesh v1.3.1, by lonewolf0622
        (https://github.com/lonewolf0622/bc250meshtaskwork, release
        directmesh-v1.3.1, commit 3977ab4)
  0003  FSR4: deferred SDot lowering, based on the V3 work of
        David Moraza Sanchez (https://github.com/dmorazasanchez/bc250-fsr4)
  0004  FSR4: combined unroll and rematerialization
  0005  FSR4: image preparation and texture shader
  0006  FSR4: 1080p and 4K+ shader bucket variants
  0007  FSR4: production defaults

These patches are carried as their authors wrote them. The MastaG series
drops the GFX10.1 IP identity hunk from the compute-queue patch because
upstream Mesa added GFX1013 to that condition in 26.2.1.

